    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEAVY AS STONE is a surreal horror investigation set in the underground sprawl of Terminal, a city sick with memory, cults, and something older still.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/13c2a7d3a72a0684e5a901ddcd721a7a.poster.avif?t=1755250605\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/13c2a7d3a72a0684e5a901ddcd721a7a.webm?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/13c2a7d3a72a0684e5a901ddcd721a7a.mp4?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are sick.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It began with a cough, a tremor, a sense that something wasn\u2019t right. Now it leaks into your work, into every conversation, every crime scene. They call it the Yellow Wound. You're not the only one infected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terminal is falling apart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath its streets lies a decaying underworld of bootleggers, cultists, and others suffering the same sickness. You're here to investigate them, or maybe just survive alongside them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/d782a60dc55ed0c1fda7b0f19cbbc48b.poster.avif?t=1755250605\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/d782a60dc55ed0c1fda7b0f19cbbc48b.webm?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/d782a60dc55ed0c1fda7b0f19cbbc48b.mp4?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embrace your demise.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symptoms evolve as you explore. Blurred vision, false sounds, shifting rooms. But afflictions can also be studied, weaponized. Learn to adapt, or be consumed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You will die.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Often. And when you do, you come back. Nothing resets. Your body stays broken. Your memories pile up. Each return deepens the clairvoyance sickness; a side effect of remembering too many versions of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/5a61045ecc1798d24fcb652fe640bd37.poster.avif?t=1755250605\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/5a61045ecc1798d24fcb652fe640bd37.webm?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/5a61045ecc1798d24fcb652fe640bd37.mp4?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is an investigation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases link together through dream logic and decaying facts. Progress isn\u2019t linear, it's layered. You\u2019ll find yourself chasing answers in places you swore you\u2019d already been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/97f99c4f7f6c9fa63f4141eec3bf2861.poster.avif?t=1755250605\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/97f99c4f7f6c9fa63f4141eec3bf2861.webm?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/97f99c4f7f6c9fa63f4141eec3bf2861.mp4?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is no cure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only patterns. Symptoms. Obsessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere under all this, something is calling you by name.</p>",
