s/97f99c4f7f6c9fa63f4141eec3bf2861.webm?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045530/extras/97f99c4f7f6c9fa63f4141eec3bf2861.mp4?t=1755250605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is no cure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only patterns. Symptoms. Obsessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere under all this, something is calling you by name.</p>",
